    <string name="privacy_summary">Student data stays on this phone</string>
    <string name="privacy_details">Intelza has no accounts, no ads and no tracking, and it doesn\'t have permission to use the internet.\n\nClasses, students, questions and results are stored only on this phone. They leave it only when you share a report, a card PDF or a backup file yourself.\n\nThe camera is used only while scanning answer cards. Images are analysed on the phone and never saved.</string>
